\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Weight: 0.05 kg (0.1 lb)</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Price: 40 gp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Price:  40  gp</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico stats.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">UNI_UND_SocietyOfBrilliance_DarkvisionRing</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:UNI_UND_SocietyOfBrilliance_DarkvisionRing\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:UNI_UND_SocietyOfBrilliance_DarkvisionRing\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">e8b6eb1d-c4f2-4b46-979c-ad3b9469030e</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:e8b6eb1d-c4f2-4b46-979c-ad3b9469030e\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:e8b6eb1d-c4f2-4b46-979c-ad3b9469030e\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>Stats</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">UND_SocietyOfBrilliance_DarkvisionRing</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:UND_SocietyOfBrilliance_DarkvisionRing+type:stat\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:UND_SocietyOfBrilliance_DarkvisionRing+type:stat\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div> \n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Special\">Special</span></h3>\n<p>The wearer of this item gains:\n\n</p>\n<dl><dt><a href=\"/wiki/Sunwalker%27s_Gift_(passive_feature)\" title=\"Sunwalker's Gift (passive feature)\">Sunwalker's Gift</a></dt><dd>The wearer can see in the dark up to 12 m / 40 ft.</dd></dl>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>    \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Ebonlake_Grotto\" title=\"Ebonlake Grotto\">Ebonlake Grotto</a> <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;111&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;-89</span>: Sold by <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Blurg\" title=\"Blurg\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b7/Portrait_Blurg.png/25px-Portrait_Blurg.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b7/Portrait_Blurg.png/38px-Portrait_Blurg.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b7/Portrait_Blurg.png/50px-Portrait_Blurg.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Blurg\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b7/Portrait_Blurg.png/25px-Portrait_Blurg.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b7/Portrait_Blurg.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Blurg\" title=\"Blurg\">Blurg</a></li></ul>\n</div>  \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Bugs\"> Bugs </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n\n<p><i>Regarding Sunwalker's Gift (passive feature):</i></p>\n<ul><li>Sunwalker's Gift does not provide the cone of light that is otherwise granted by the Darkvision effect from a different source, such as the <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Darkvision_(spell)\" title=\"Darkvision (spell)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/01/Darkvision_spell_Icon.webp/20px-Darkvision_spell_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/01/Darkvision_spell_Icon.webp/30px-Darkvision_spell_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/01/Darkvision_spell_Icon.webp/40px-Darkvision_spell_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Darkvision\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/01/Darkvision_spell_Icon.webp/20px-Darkvision_spell_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/01/Darkvision_spell_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Darkvision_(spell)\" title=\"Darkvision (spell)\">Darkvision</a> spell, the <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-uncommon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Elixir_of_Darkvision\" title=\"Elixir of Darkvision\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a4/ELX_Elixir_of_Darkvision_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-ELX_Elixir_of_Darkvision_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/a4/ELX_Elixir_of_Darkvision_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-ELX_Elixir_of_Darkvision_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/a4/ELX_Elixir_of_Darkvision_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-ELX_Elixir_of_Darkvision_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a4/ELX_Elixir_of_Darkvision_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-ELX_Elixir_of_Darkvision_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/a4/ELX_Elixir_of_Darkvision_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Elixir_of_Darkvision\" title=\"Elixir of Darkvision\">Elixir of Darkvision</a>, or the <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Darkvision\" title=\"Darkvision\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0d/Darkvision_Icon.webp/20px-Darkvision_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/0d/Darkvision_Icon.webp/30px-Darkvision_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/0d/Darkvision_Icon.webp/40px-Darkvision_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Darkvision\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0d/Darkvision_Icon.webp/20px-Darkvision_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/0d/Darkvision_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Darkvision\" title=\"Darkvision\">Darkvision</a> racial passive.</li></ul>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"External_links\">External links</span></h2>\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Sunwalker%27s_Gift\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><picture><source srcset